94,0,n$There are few reports o f Ascozonus, apart from A. woolhopensis. Observed spore sizes of A. woolhopensis suggest that measurement o f Kenny's (1874) illustrations o f spores leads to values which are too large (19-20 x 6-6.5 µm ). Those in parentheses are what they might be, based on the discrepancy between observed values for A. woolhopensis and Renny’s illustration.
